### Variables (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client both understand this file)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### Register a new user
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "s3cret-password"
}

### Log in - copy the "token" from the response into auth-token below
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "s3cret-password"
}

### Exchange the refresh token for a new pair (rotates the session)
@refresh-token = paste-refresh-token-here

POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh-token}}"
}

### Log out - revokes the refresh token; the access token lives out its TTL
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh-token}}"
}

### Who am I? (requires a token from /auth/login)
@token = paste-token-here

GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health check (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Readiness check - also pings the database
GET {{host}}/readyz
